,{"text":"：元素的底部与行框的底部对齐","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eb7268a4-7cdc-4196-be3e-e91d2cf04b97","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2243bda6-560e-467d-aece-d66eca3c9073","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"8022c05f-ebb5-40cf-ac92-1825e6b901a6","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"bd9c3060-fdb4-44ad-8f00-21743d07a1fb","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"4b88132e-17a4-4768-8aaf-018aeb3b39fe","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"100fba84-99e2-4c3f-b311-c2ab57de763d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_52512a71-c366-422e-8d0e-c2ab89ca86a9.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_52512a71-c366-422e-8d0e-c2ab89ca86a9.png","uuid":"7f7091ba-69db-42d2-8b3e-3aabe3a0783d","width":433.8461385760795},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"baseline","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"middle","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"text-top","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 等值，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（基线、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x-height","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、内容区顶部）是从哪里来的？它们是由父元素的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"font-size","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"font-family","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性预先定义好的。 浏览器在处理一个元素时，可以立即根据父元素的字体属性，知道它应该对齐的基线在哪里。这个参考线是“静态的”、“预先确定的”。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"598c61f6-0dc4-48e1-9cf8-a81079a42069","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"top","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"bottom","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（行框的顶边和底边）是从哪里来的？它们不是由父元素预先定义好的。 它必须先处理完同一行所有的兄弟元素，找出谁最高、谁最低，从而确定整个行框的最终边界。然后，它才能回过头来，把这个元素的顶部对齐到那个最终计算出来的边界上。这个参考线是“动态的”、“事后确定的”。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e9bf92a0-28c2-4e4f-8cd1-a530296b33b8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"e961663d-d1df-4081-8677-74bfc584e67a","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"为什么是这么分类的？","type":"callout"},{"calloutType":"warning","children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"vertical-align","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 只能用于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inline","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inline-block","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"table-cell","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 元素，不能用于块级元素。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7323aec0-6791-46b1-8992-ba8f09998f8f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1ad5a850-6426-474b-8aa8-e9f14df65411","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"为了理解上述表述，我们需要先理解两个概念，行内元素的基线和行框的基线。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e1584870-6def-41a8-81db-e1e12ebf6a9e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"行内元素的基线是什么：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5ced3e51-f30a-47c3-9fc2-b840909fcd50